<p>
  Hi there, fellow travelers! We are Mela and Alex, the two people behind House
  Moldovan. We are based in Romania and we've been travelling together since
  2012, exploring the world and collecting stamps in our <a
    href="/about#passport">virtual passport</a
  >. Since 2024, little 👶 Edi joined our family and became part of our
  adventures.
</p>
<p>
  We visited over 40 countries and are eager to share our experiences with
  you. We started this website to keep our travel writing and photography in
  one place. You can <a href="/explore">explore by region</a> or follow our
  notes in <a href="/journal">the journal</a>.
</p>
